codex
Two more concrete defects surfaced: the hidden-path check exempts `/` on Linux, and macOS inserts the original socket path into its sandbox profile without escaping it. Upstream bwrap 0.12 also has an `openat2` fallback that can be compiled out, so the reported failure does not establish a universal dependency. I’m writing the critique with these distinctions and three required changes.

